sgp-stats — source attributions
================================

This project compiles publicly available Speedway Grand Prix results into an Elo
ranking. Every heat stored in the database is derived from a real raw artifact
saved on disk under data/raw/ (URL + fetched_at + sha256). No data is invented.

1995-2019 heat-by-heat data
  Source : https://github.com/gogonzo/sport  (datasets gpheats.rda, gpsquads.rda)
  License: GPL-2
  Use    : Re-distributed/derived under GPL-2. See that repository for terms.

2020-2026 heat-by-heat data
  Source : https://www.fimspeedway.com/sgp  (official SGP results)
  Use    : Public results, retrieved for personal/statistical use, rate-limited,
           respecting robots.txt (Allow: /). Not used for AI training.

2020-2026 round-total verification (cross-check only, not stored as heats)
  Source : https://en.wikipedia.org  (..._Speedway_Grand_Prix_of_* articles)
  License: CC-BY-SA 4.0

Trademarks "Speedway Grand Prix" / "SGP" belong to their respective owners.
This is an unofficial, non-commercial statistics project.
